      "name": {
        "name": "CDK5 and ABL1 enzyme substrate 1/2",
        "short": "CABLES1/2"
      },
      "description": [
        {
          "text": "<p>This group represents protein CABLES (CDK5 and ABL1 enzyme substrate), including CABLES1 and CABLES2 [[cite:PUB00016076], [cite:PUB00015978]]. CABLES1 is a cyclin-dependent kinase binding protein, primarily involved in cell cycle regulation [[cite:PUB00073756]]. CABLES1 binds to different functional domains of p53 and p73 and modifies their cell death-inducing activities [[cite:PUB00033517]]. It may be a tumour suppressor in human ovarian cancer [[cite:PUB00073756]]. CABLES2 is involved in both p53-mediated and p53-independent apoptotic pathways [[cite:PUB00073479]].</p>",
          "llm": false,
          "checked": false,
          "updated": false
        }
      ],
